								1
							</td>
							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1.0">General Discussion</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.150#msg16325">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: April 10, 2005, 12:10:05 am
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">With Union of Power successfully taking out down the Rathe Council and the Avatar of Earth tonight - we are now Time flagged.</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td colspan="3" class="windowbg2" align="right">
