						<tr class="titlebg">
							<td align="left" style="padding: 0 1ex;">
								2
							</td>
							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1.0">General Discussion</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1507.15#msg16114">Re: Question about Plane of Time</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: April 01, 2005, 01:07:03 pm
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Union of Power will be in Time by May 12th.  We would very much welcome the opportunity to be included in a Time-share rotation.  Preferably Sunday, Tuesday, and/or Thursday.  We can and will be flexible, as we too are forging new ground.  Please feel free to contact me personally regarding this matter.</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td colspan="3" class="windowbg2" align="right">
							</td>
						</tr>
					</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
