								4
							</td>
							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=8.0">Rodcet Nife Guilds</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1283.0#msg14058">Re: Union of Power - Recruiting</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: January 31, 2005, 10:02:11 am
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">At last!!&nbsp; After some hard work and awesome member dedication, UoP now has a new home!!&nbsp; Stop by and say &quot;hi&quot; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /><br /><br /><a href="http://www.guildportal.com/Guild.aspx?GuildID=23913&amp;TabID=216215" target="_blank">http://www.guildportal.com/Guild.aspx?GuildID=23913&amp;TabID=216215</a></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td colspan="3" class="windowbg2" align="right">
