							<td align="left" style="padding: 0 1ex;">
								5
							</td>
							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1.0">General Discussion</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.3045#msg13547">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
