								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=8.0">Rodcet Nife Guilds</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1283.0#msg13204">Re: Union of Power - Recruiting</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: December 16, 2004, 03:06:31 pm
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">If you think Union of Power might be for you, come find me in game, and we can chat about it!</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td colspan="3" class="windowbg2" align="right">
							</td>
