					<table border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" class="bordercolor" align="center">
						<tr class="titlebg">
							<td align="left" style="padding: 0 1ex;">
								7
							</td>
							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=8.0">Rodcet Nife Guilds</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1283.0#msg12788">Re: Union of Power - Recruiting</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: November 23, 2004, 11:00:28 am
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Union of Power considers itself a casual guild.&nbsp; We understand that this is a game, and that real life happens.&nbsp; We will not tell you how to play your game, as raiding is not required.&nbsp; We typically raid three nights a week.&nbsp; We invite you to come join us! <a href="http://www.unionofpower.org" target="_blank">www.unionofpower.org</a> <br /></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td colspan="3" class="windowbg2" align="right">
							</td>
						</tr>
					</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
