		<table border="0" width="85%" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="0" class="bordercolor" align="center">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%">
					<table border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" class="bordercolor" align="center">
						<tr class="titlebg">
							<td align="left" style="padding: 0 1ex;">
								8
							</td>
							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=8.0">Rodcet Nife Guilds</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1283.0#msg12775">Union of Power - Recruiting</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: November 22, 2004, 01:36:19 pm
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Union of Power is currently accepting applications.  <br /><br />Union of Power is one of the oldest guilds on RCN.  It has weathered many changes as the Everquest world has expanded. Through and through, Union of Power has been and will always be a guild that believes in playing honorably, helping out our fellow characters, equality and fellowship.<br /><br />Union of Power is not for people who only want to join a guild for material profit.  In general, if you want to raid regularly, good friends to chat with, good players to group with, and a guild to support you when you are in need, then you will enjoy this guild.<br /><br />The primary focus of this guild is to have fun and raid on a regular basis.  We wish to experience a higher level of gaming/adventuring and the satisfaction of success as a group is our true reward.<br /><br />We are currently accepting members of all races and classes. While, it is a preferance that applicants are elemental flagged, it is not required.  At present, there is a minimum 65th level is required to join Union of Power. If you are interested in joining Union of Power please visit our NEW website<br /><br /><a href="http://www.guildportal.com/Guild.aspx?GuildID=23913&amp;TabID=216215" target="_blank">http://www.guildportal.com/Guild.aspx?GuildID=23913&amp;TabID=216215</a><br /><br />If you have additional questions or would like more information, please feel free to contact Grimborn or Yalle in game, or via email.<br /><br />We look forward to meeting you and welcoming you into our family as we press forward.<br /></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td colspan="3" class="windowbg2" align="right">
							</td>
						</tr>
